{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S01、S04、S08、S09等段落的非定时感受仍然比较密集，整体扫读速度不如Y的左右分栏；但定时出现的内容缓解了部分压力。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X虽然视觉负担更大，但【】突出每段关键心理变化，人物为什么舍不得、为什么害怕、为什么不愿回头，交代得更具体，尤其反复出现的“被当作自己人”构成了贯穿全篇的情感主线。X的感受不仅细分了情绪，还通过舞步、三连音、八度、和弦等具体音乐线索呈现情绪的发生和转变，且定时出现的设计让感受与音乐进程更贴合；Y更容易快速扫读，但部分心理动机和音乐细节被概括成了较笼统的标签。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4e3e40f4-201b-4c6a-a397-c77c7232e307", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T062337815958Z", "elapsed_seconds": 111.594, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T06:25:29.426840+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c0cbf25266825ad30f3334fa9c8fd48fc6c29c4aed6be27a257028ce62c96b2f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools